{"k":"note","text":"sum3(11, 22, 33) — the same call marshalled two ways: System V (left) reads rdi, rsi, rdx; Microsoft x64 (right) reads rcx, rdx, r8. Step the walkthrough to watch a0 land in a different register on each side."}
